# UBSan suppressions for the instrumented HDF5/netCDF campaign (doc/fuzzing.md).
#
# HDF5's high-level dimension-scale code (`H5DSiterate_scales`, reached from netCDF-4's
# `nc_inq_var` through `get_attached_info`) reads the reference array of a corrupt
# `DIMENSION_LIST` attribute without checking it: the load is of a garbage pointer
# (0xbebebebe..., ASan's malloc fill) and UBSan reports it as misaligned. It is in the
# pinned HDF5 1.14.6's `hl/src/H5DS.c`, reproduces on a mutated valid file, and has no
# meshio++ frame above `nc_inq_varndims`, so the reader cannot prevent it. Matched by
# source file and kind only: every other UBSan report, in the libraries and in meshio++,
# still fails the campaign.
alignment:H5DS.c
